59
00:03:42.180 --> 00:03:44.990
Millised kraed.

60
00:03:45.090 --> 00:03:46.630
Millised varrukad?

61
00:03:46.730 --> 00:03:51.110
Aga mood on mood on midagi sellist
väga südamelähedast ja.

